    ^{:line 271 :tag atomic/Int64 :doc "dedicatedMarkTime is the nanoseconds spent in dedicated mark workers\nduring this cycle. This is updated at the end of the concurrent mark\nphase.\n"} dedicatedMarkTime





    ^{:line 277 :tag atomic/Int64 :doc "fractionalMarkTime is the nanoseconds spent in the fractional mark\nworker during this cycle. This is updated throughout the cycle and\nwill be up-to-date if the fractional mark worker is not currently\nrunning.\n"} fractionalMarkTime



